# IT-Ren site parameter list with lognormal priors
# Format: parameter_name pft lognormal log_mean log_std min max
#
# Lognormal distribution strategy:
# - log_mean: natural log of the geometric mean of [min, max]
# - log_std: controls spread (0.3-0.5 = moderate spread, 0.5-0.8 = wider spread)
#
# Geometric mean = sqrt(min * max)
# log_mean = ln(geometric_mean) = (ln(min) + ln(max)) / 2
#
# Examples with different spread levels:
# - log_std = 0.3: ~68% of values within exp(±0.3) = [0.74, 1.35] × median
# - log_std = 0.5: ~68% of values within exp(±0.5) = [0.61, 1.65] × median
# - log_std = 0.7: ~68% of values within exp(±0.7) = [0.50, 2.01] × median

# Original: froottcn 1 20 184
# Geometric mean = sqrt(20 * 184) = 60.6, log_mean = ln(60.6) = 4.104
# Using moderate spread (log_std = 0.5)
froottcn 1 lognormal 4.104 0.5 20 184

# Original: frootacn 1 11 119
# Geometric mean = sqrt(11 * 119) = 36.2, log_mean = ln(36.2) = 3.589
frootacn 1 lognormal 3.589 0.5 11 119

# Original: frootmcn 1 7 25
# Geometric mean = sqrt(7 * 25) = 13.2, log_mean = ln(13.2) = 2.580
frootmcn 1 lognormal 2.580 0.5 7 25

